    "Id": "chassisdef_imp_IMP-4W",
    "Name": "Imp",
    "Details": "A Wolf's Dragoons custom refit of the Imp, using all Clan tech. The 'Mech's primary weapons are two ER PPC, two Large Pulse Lasers and two LRM-15 with attached Artemis IV FCS. As secondary fireline the 4W carries two ER Medium Laser and two Medium Pulse Laser, while two ER Small Lasers are kept for defensive purposes.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
